# Owners must be GitHub teams (e.g. @surrealdb/<team>), not individuals.
# Last matching rule wins; put broad defaults first, tighten with paths below.
#
# NOTE: @surrealdb/devex is a team in the `surrealdb` org. While this repo
# lives in `surrealdb-dev` these entries do not resolve, because a team can
# only own repos in its own org. They become active on promotion to
# `surrealdb`. See https://github.com/surrealdb-dev/security

# Default owners for the repository
* @surrealdb/devex

# Configuration for CI
/.github/ @surrealdb/devex

# Security policy and code ownership
SECURITY.md @surrealdb/devex
/.github/CODEOWNERS @surrealdb/devex

# Agent instruction files (attack surface for prompt injection via PRs).
# This repo ships agent skills and hooks, so its instruction files ARE the
# product — every change to them is an instruction-surface change.
/plugins/ @surrealdb/devex
*.kiro.hook @surrealdb/devex
/scripts/ @surrealdb/devex
